{"step_index":71,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T21:16:06Z","content":"Now I'll build in well-organized parallel waves. Let me start with the foundational shared files first:","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n * ║  BREW & BLOOM CAFÉ — CENTRAL CONFIGURATION              ║\n * ║  Edit this file to customise your café platform.        ║\n * ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n */\n\nconst CONFIG = {\n\n  /* ── CAFÉ IDENTITY ─────────────────────────────────────── */\n  cafe: {\n    name:        'Brew & Bloom Café',\n    tagline:     'Good Coffee. Slow Moments. Beautiful Days.',\n    address:     '[Sample Address], Near [Landmark], Haldia, West Bengal – 721657',\n    city:        'Haldia, West Bengal',\n    phone:       '+91 00000 00000',       // ← Replace with real number\n    email:       'hello@brewandbloom.in', // ← Replace with real email\n    whatsapp:    '910000000000',          // ← Replace (country code + number, no symbols)\n    instagram:   '#',                     // ← Replace with Instagram URL\n    facebook:    '#',                     // ← Replace with Facebook URL\n  },\n\n  /* ── RESTAURANT LOCATION ───────────────────────────────── */\n  // ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Replace with your actual café GPS coordinates.\n  // To find: Google Maps → right-click your location → \"What's here?\"\n  restaurant: {\n    lat:  22.0667,   // ← Replace: Haldia approximate coordinates\n    lng:  88.0686,   // ← Replace: Haldia approximate coordinates\n    name: 'Brew & Bloom Café',\n    address: '[Sample Address], Haldia, WB',\n  },\n\n  /* ── DELIVERY SETTINGS ─────────────────────────────────── */\n  delivery: {\n    radiusKm:        10,     // Max delivery radius in km\n    baseCharge:      30,     // ₹ base delivery charge\n    perKmCharge:     5,      // ₹ per km beyond 3km\n    freeAbove:       500,    // ₹ order total for free delivery\n    freeRadiusKm:    3,      // km within which delivery is free (if order >= freeAbove)\n    minOrderAmount:  100,    // ₹ minimum order\n    estimatedMinBase: 30,    // minutes base prep + short delivery\n    perKmMinutes:     3,     // additional minutes per km\n  },\n\n  /* ── TAXES ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  tax: {\n    gstPercent: 5,   // % GST applied on food subtotal\n    // Set to 0 to disable tax display\n  },\n\n  /* ── OPENING HOURS ─────────────────────────────────────── */\n  hours: {\n    'Mon–Fri': { open: '08:00', close: '21:00' },\n    'Saturday': { open: '08:00', close: '22:00' },\n    'Sunday':   { open: '09:00', close: '20:00' },\n  },\n\n  /* ── SUPABASE (Backend) ─────────────────────────────────── */\n  // Sign up free at https://supabase.com → create project → Settings → API\n  // NEVER commit real keys to public GitHub.\n  // Use environment variables in production (Vercel env vars).\n  supabase: {\n    url:    typeof __SUPABASE_URL__    !== 'undefined' ? __SUPABASE_URL__    : '',\n    anonKey: typeof __SUPABASE_ANON__ !== 'undefined' ? __SUPABASE_ANON__   : '',\n    // If both are empty, the app runs in localStorage-only demo mode.\n  },\n\n  /* ── PAYMENT ────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  payment: {\n    codEnabled:     true,\n    upiEnabled:     true,\n    upiId:          'yourname@upi',  // ← Replace with your UPI ID\n    upiName:        'Brew & Bloom Café',\n    // Online gateway (Razorpay / Cashfree): set keyId below.\n    // Leave empty to show demo-mode UPI only.\n    razorpayKeyId:  '',              // ← Optional: Razorpay key_id\n  },\n\n  /* ── ORDER TRACKING ─────────────────────────────────────── */\n  tracking: {\n    // If Supabase is not configured, demo mode kicks in automatically.\n    // Demo simulates a driver moving from restaurant to customer.\n    locationUpdateIntervalMs: 5000,  // How often driver app sends GPS (ms)\n    demoRouteSteps: 20,              // Steps in simulated demo route\n  },\n\n  /* ── MAP ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */\n  map: {\n    defaultZoom: 14,\n    // OSRM public routing API (free, no key needed)\n    osrmBase: 'https://router.project-osrm.org/route/v1/driving',\n    // Tile server (OpenStreetMap — free, no key)\n    tileUrl: 'https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png',\n    tileAttribution: '© <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/\">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors',\n  },\n\n};\n\n// Freeze so nothing accidentally mutates config\nObject.freeze(CONFIG);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.cafe);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.restaurant);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.delivery);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.tax);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.supabase);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.payment);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.tracking);\nObject.freeze(CONFIG.map);\n\nexport default CONFIG;\n","Description":"Central configuration — all editable values in one place","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Lenovo\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\brew-and-bloom\\js\\config.js","toolAction":"Creating config module","toolSummary":"Central config file"}}]}
